  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida organiserar ett semianrium med UNRISD om Social policy in a development context, p&#xe5; Sida den 31 otkboer 2006 f&#xf6;r att sprida resultatet av UNRISD forsknignsresultat av flaggskeppet &quot;Social policy in a development context&quot;. underlaget skall anv&#xe4;ndas f&#xf6;r Sidas positionspapper om sociala trygghetssystem. En rapport skall skrivas fr&#xe5;n seminariet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida organizes a seminar with UNRISD on Social Policy in a development context, Oectober 31 2006, in roder to disseminate findings of UNRISD research flagship on the topic. The aim is also that the seminar gives input to a Sida position paper on social security. A report will be submitted of the seminar.</narrative>
